OL,3,GNEWSAPM gives boost to return of
OL,4,Ainternational trains to Ashford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said the
OL,7,Fgovernment will look into bringing
OL,8,Finternational services back to Ashford
OL,9,Frailway station.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham said he would ask the
OL,12,Ftransport secretary to explore the
OL,13,Fpossibility of restoring services to
OL,14,Fthe hub in Kent, which were suspended
OL,15,Fduring the Covid pandemic in 2020 and
OL,16,Fhave yet to resume.
OL,18,FHelena Dollimore, the Labour MP for
OL,19,FHastings and Rye, said the move would
OL,20,Fbring a #2.7bn boost to Kent and Sussex
OL,21,Fand attract more than 500,000 visitors
OL,22,Fannually.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
